  "version": "v1.7.0.4",
  "body": [
    {
      "from": 0.08,
      "to": 2.82,
      "sid": 1,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Today, I've come to Little Saigon in Seattle's Vietnamese Town.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 2.82,
      "to": 5.83,
      "sid": 2,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Let's start with a quick tour of the busiest corner here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 5.83,
      "to": 7.71,
      "sid": 3,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I wonder if this brings back memories of",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 7.71,
      "to": 9.33,
      "sid": 4,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "some street in Philadelphia.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 9.33,
      "to": 11.11,
      "sid": 5,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To ensure you can see clearly in the evening,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 11.11,
      "to": 13.19,
      "sid": 6,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "we're now switching to daytime mode.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 13.19,
      "to": 16.09,
      "sid": 7,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This street is actually much more diverse compared to Kensington Street.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 16.09,
      "to": 17.27,
      "sid": 8,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's not just about the homeless.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 17.27,
      "to": 19.55,
      "sid": 9,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The location of this corner is truly unique.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 19.55,
      "to": 21.99,
      "sid": 10,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's located at the main intersection in the city of Vietnam.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 21.99,
      "to": 24.56,
      "sid": 11,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are also many large Asian supermarkets around.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 24.56,
      "to": 26.12,
      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So at least during the day,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 26.12,
      "to": 27.28,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "this corner is quite lively,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 27.28,
      "to": 29.64,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with a mix of Asians and homeless individuals coexisting.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 29.64,
      "to": 31.24,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many of them are elderly.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 31.24,
      "to": 33.12,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are a lot of bus routes here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 33.12,
      "to": 34.6,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and while they wait for their buses,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 34.6,
      "to": 37.4,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "some people sell items of dubious origin.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 37.4,
      "to": 39.06,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Make a bit of profit for them",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 39.06,
      "to": 40.48,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "With this street corner as the core",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 40.48,
      "to": 43.48,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are also many scattered small organizations in the nearby blocks",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 43.48,
      "to": 44.92,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Whether on the main streets",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 44.92,
      "to": 46.88,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In the alleys or on various squares",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 46.88,
      "to": 48.22,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can see their presence",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 48.22,
      "to": 50.129,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Flexible housing is also abundant around here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 50.129,
      "to": 52.529,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The guy ahead is even sleeping right on the street",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 52.529,
      "to": 54.889,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although most homeless people are not aggressive",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 54.889,
      "to": 56.889,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But their impact on the surrounding businesses and residents is",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 56.889,
      "to": 58.1,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "quite significant.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 58.1,
      "to": 59.42,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Like on this road ahead of me,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 59.42,
      "to": 61.38,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it seems that all the residential buildings have been vacated.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 61.38,
      "to": 63.62,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There used to be a fairly large shopping center here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 63.62,
      "to": 64.66,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but upon closer inspection,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 64.66,
      "to": 66.0,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "many shops have closed down.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 66.0,
      "to": 68.6,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The original building structures, however, can still provide shelter from the wind and rain,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 68.6,
      "to": 71.009,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "so many people have set up home at the entrances of these stores.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 71.009,
      "to": 72.209,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Besides the street corner at the beginning",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 72.209,
      "to": 73.409,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the favorite place for the homeless to go",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 73.409,
      "to": 75.309,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is a park that was built just half a year ago",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 75.309,
      "to": 77.029,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "originally intended to be a children's playground",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 77.029,
      "to": 79.1,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but it ended up becoming a haven for the homeless",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 79.1,
      "to": 81.76,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and as a result, it has earned a Google rating of 01:03",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 81.76,
      "to": 83.3,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'll take you all for a tour inside",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 83.3,
      "to": 83.76,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to see",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 83.76,
      "to": 85.58,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "how this Little Saigon has transformed into what it is now",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 85.58,
      "to": 88.45,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The culprit is the high density of homeless shelters nearby.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 88.45,
      "to": 90.65,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Seattle has experienced rapid growth over the past decade.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 90.65,
      "to": 92.57,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Housing and rental prices have also risen accordingly.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 92.57,
      "to": 94.57,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There aren't many affordable housing options here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 94.57,
      "to": 96.22,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many people simply can't afford the rent.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 96.22,
      "to": 99.28,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The earliest form was tents sprouting up all over the city.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 99.28,
      "to": 101.12,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As the homeless issue became more severe,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 101.12,
      "to": 103.18,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the local government decided to take action.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 103.18,
      "to": 105.68,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So they began researching locations for homeless shelters.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 105.68,
      "to": 108.02,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most people don’t want something like this built next to their homes.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 108.02,
      "to": 108.82,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Such a place.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 108.82,
      "to": 111.64,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Given that many Americans have a high level of political engagement,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 111.64,
      "to": 113.4,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the city government often targets the easier groups to pressure.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 113.4,
      "to": 115.5,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They naturally think of the Asian community.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 115.5,
      "to": 118.64,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In many other major American cities, there are similar situations.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 118.64,
      "to": 121.6,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It’s about placing homeless shelters near Chinatown.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 121.6,
      "to": 124.259,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "However, in the picture, there are even more vulnerable Vietnamese people.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 124.259,
      "to": 125.759,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This area is referred to as Little Saigon.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 125.759,
      "to": 127.639,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's also part of the broader Chinatown area",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 127.639,
      "to": 130.259,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "just a 10-minute walk from the heart of Chinatown",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 130.259,
      "to": 130.62,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 130.62,
      "to": 133.34,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "across the street from this store is a Vietnamese seafood market",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 133.34,
      "to": 135.22,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "just by looking at the wire mesh, you can tell",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 135.22,
      "to": 137.329,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "this place still has quite some fortifications",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 137.329,
      "to": 139.449,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "this store has been around since the 90s",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 139.449,
      "to": 141.349,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the inside is actually quite peaceful and serene",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 141.349,
      "to": 143.04,
      "sid": 72,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are actually quite a few people coming here to shop",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 143.04,
      "to": 145.64,
      "sid": 73,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They have a 4.1 rating on Google Maps",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 145.64,
      "to": 147.54,
      "sid": 74,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Which is pretty good for an Asian supermarket",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 147.54,
      "to": 150.44,
      "sid": 75,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many negative comments are about the homeless people outside",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 150.44,
      "to": 151.42,
      "sid": 76,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "For example, these",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 151.42,
      "to": 153.24,
      "sid": 77,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Of course, there are also positive reviews",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 153.24,
      "to": 155.22,
      "sid": 78,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Great store, a bit scary",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 155.22,
      "to": 156.82,
      "sid": 79,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But it’s actually not bad",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 156.82,
      "to": 159.48,
      "sid": 80,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Just be cautious around the homeless",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 159.48,
      "to": 161.1,
      "sid": 81,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And the sick drug users",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 161.1,
      "to": 162.32,
      "sid": 82,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They are still human beings.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 162.32,
      "to": 163.02,
      "sid": 83,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Don't be afraid.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 163.02,
      "to": 163.8,
      "sid": 84,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Say hi.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 163.8,
      "to": 165.04,
      "sid": 85,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How was your day today?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 165.04,
      "to": 166.69,
      "sid": 86,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I like the culture here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 166.69,
      "to": 169.89,
      "sid": 87,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The homeless people there have always been kind to me.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 169.89,
      "to": 172.31,
      "sid": 88,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I certainly wouldn't buy a live fish to take home.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 172.31,
      "to": 173.35,
      "sid": 89,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, I don't know how to cook it either.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 173.35,
      "to": 176.17,
      "sid": 90,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'll just try one of their fast food fish dishes instead.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 176.17,
      "to": 179.05,
      "sid": 91,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "What do you all think of the look of their dishes?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 179.05,
