      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 340.94,
      "to": 341.84,
      "sid": 186,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It would be bad.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 341.84,
      "to": 342.58,
      "sid": 187,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You call them over.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 342.58,
      "to": 343.61,
      "sid": 188,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He'll come.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 343.61,
      "to": 344.11,
      "sid": 189,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He won't.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 344.11,
      "to": 344.83,
      "sid": 190,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Take a look at them.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 344.83,
      "to": 345.87,
      "sid": 191,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He can walk, you know.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 345.87,
      "to": 348.9,
      "sid": 192,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But they know they won't steal here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 348.9,
      "to": 350.28,
      "sid": 193,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I will hit him, of course.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 350.28,
      "to": 352.4,
      "sid": 194,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He just walks around there, yeah.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 352.4,
      "to": 355.92,
      "sid": 195,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That’s the issue, it really has a bad impact, you see.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 355.92,
      "to": 357.62,
      "sid": 196,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It’s quite negative, yeah.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 357.62,
      "to": 360.02,
      "sid": 197,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It feels like many Chinese people are afraid to come here to shop now.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 360.02,
      "to": 360.62,
      "sid": 198,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Right.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 360.62,
      "to": 362.82,
      "sid": 199,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That's the kind of person who showed up.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 362.82,
      "to": 364.13,
      "sid": 200,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He bought soda.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 364.13,
      "to": 366.55,
      "sid": 201,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The stuff in this supermarket is really quite affordable and practical.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 366.55,
      "to": 367.91,
      "sid": 202,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And as netizens mentioned,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 367.91,
      "to": 370.8,
      "sid": 203,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Beyond the iron gate, it’s a completely different world.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 370.8,
      "to": 372.82,
      "sid": 204,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Before getting ready to leave by bus,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 372.82,
      "to": 375.46,
      "sid": 205,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I suddenly felt that the boxed meal I just had didn’t really fill me up.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 375.46,
      "to": 378.1,
      "sid": 206,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So I decided to head to the Vietnamese noodle shop closest to the street corner.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 378.1,
      "to": 379.08,
      "sid": 207,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "For another meal.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 379.08,
      "to": 380.34,
      "sid": 208,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In my opinion,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 380.34,
      "to": 382.46,
      "sid": 209,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "whether it's Kensington Street or here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 382.46,
      "to": 384.54,
      "sid": 210,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it's actually not as dangerous as people imagine.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 384.54,
      "to": 386.62,
      "sid": 211,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most of the homeless people are not aggressive.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 386.62,
      "to": 389.04,
      "sid": 212,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The main concern is the poor hygiene conditions.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 389.04,
      "to": 390.12,
      "sid": 213,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The smell can be quite strong,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 390.12,
      "to": 392.59,
      "sid": 214,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the visual impact is also significant.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 392.59,
      "to": 394.61,
      "sid": 215,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Homeless people need friends and social interaction too,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 394.61,
      "to": 397.19,
      "sid": 216,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and they have various needs for resource exchange.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 397.19,
      "to": 398.419,
      "sid": 217,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "We need to stick together",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 398.419,
      "to": 401.179,
      "sid": 218,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The essence of this street is actually similar to playing cards on the streets back home",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 401.179,
      "to": 402.84,
      "sid": 219,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or doing square dancing, pretty much",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 402.84,
      "to": 405.28,
      "sid": 220,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Ever since the rise of this Little Saigon corner",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 405.28,
      "to": 407.0,
      "sid": 221,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which used to be a gathering spot for many homeless people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 407.0,
      "to": 408.74,
      "sid": 222,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you can visibly see a lot fewer people around",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 408.74,
      "to": 411.04,
      "sid": 223,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'll also take you to check out those spots later",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 411.04,
      "to": 411.94,
      "sid": 224,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Across the street corner",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 411.94,
      "to": 413.37,
      "sid": 225,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is the Vietnamese noodle shop I'm heading to",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 413.37,
      "to": 415.57,
      "sid": 226,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Due to the severe decline in the restaurant industry here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 415.57,
      "to": 416.97,
      "sid": 227,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "they even wrote a big sign,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 416.97,
      "to": 418.06,
      "sid": 228,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "saying we are still in business.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 418.06,
      "to": 419.82,
      "sid": 229,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The view from this glass window is pretty good.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 419.82,
      "to": 422.28,
      "sid": 230,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The guy sitting in front of me seems to be a first-time visitor here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 422.28,
      "to": 424.429,
      "sid": 231,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He was eating while looking out the window,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 424.429,
      "to": 427.3,
      "sid": 232,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with a very complicated expression on his face.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 431.44,
      "to": 432.52,
      "sid": 233,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After making a phone call,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 432.52,
      "to": 433.56,
      "sid": 234,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "my rice noodles arrived.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 433.56,
      "to": 434.84,
      "sid": 235,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The taste isn't particularly memorable.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 434.84,
      "to": 436.26,
      "sid": 236,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It was just average, really.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 436.26,
      "to": 437.81,
      "sid": 237,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It wasn't especially delicious.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 437.81,
      "to": 439.61,
      "sid": 238,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But I do have a thing for rice noodles.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 439.61,
      "to": 441.29,
      "sid": 239,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So I finished it all anyway.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 441.29,
      "to": 443.29,
      "sid": 240,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The meal, including the tip, came to 22 dollars.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 443.29,
      "to": 445.25,
      "sid": 241,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If it were just for the taste, it wouldn't be worth it.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 445.25,
      "to": 446.93,
      "sid": 242,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the view from here is pretty good.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 446.93,
      "to": 449.26,
      "sid": 243,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Paying for the experience is definitely something to consider.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 449.26,
      "to": 451.4,
      "sid": 244,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Not only does the guy in front of me love looking outside,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 451.4,
      "to": 453.04,
      "sid": 245,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but even when I was leaving on the bus,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 453.04,
      "to": 455.4,
      "sid": 246,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the passengers on the bus couldn't help but look out the window.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 455.4,
      "to": 457.76,
      "sid": 247,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's possible that many people ended up in this area by accident,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 457.76,
      "to": 459.34,
      "sid": 248,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "even the bus driver.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 459.34,
      "to": 460.48,
      "sid": 249,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I was originally going to put in a coin,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 460.48,
      "to": 462.4,
      "sid": 250,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but he directly gave me a bus ticket,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 462.4,
      "to": 463.82,
      "sid": 251,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "urging me to get on the bus quickly.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 463.82,
      "to": 465.26,
      "sid": 252,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The ride from the stream took about 20 minutes.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 465.26,
      "to": 466.66,
      "sid": 253,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This bus route 106",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 466.66,
      "to": 468.44,
      "sid": 254,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "can take you to the suburbs of Seattle.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 468.44,
      "to": 470.58,
      "sid": 255,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now, this area has become a new Vietnamese community.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 470.58,
      "to": 472.34,
      "sid": 256,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Due to the current situation in Little Creek Gully,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 472.34,
      "to": 473.84,
      "sid": 257,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "many people can no longer sustain their businesses.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 473.84,
      "to": 476.36,
      "sid": 258,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They have been forced to relocate to the suburbs.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 480.26,
      "to": 482.7,
      "sid": 259,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Besides forcing Vietnamese residents to move to the suburbs,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 482.7,
      "to": 484.66,
      "sid": 260,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the thriving homeless market in Little Creek Gully",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 484.66,
      "to": 488.07,
      "sid": 261,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "has also led to the decline of the traditional homeless district in Seattle.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 488.07,
      "to": 489.67,
      "sid": 262,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Actually, if you dig into the past,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 489.67,
      "to": 491.67,
      "sid": 263,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the first video on my channel was filmed at",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 491.67,
      "to": 493.419,
      "sid": 264,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the McDonald's in downtown Seattle.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 493.419,
      "to": 495.859,
      "sid": 265,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is also where my dream of making videos began.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 495.859,
      "to": 497.419,
      "sid": 266,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Through the footage from ten months ago,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 497.419,
      "to": 499.98,
      "sid": 267,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you can still vaguely see the former prosperity.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 499.98,
      "to": 501.02,
      "sid": 268,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But now,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 501.02,
      "to": 503.18,
      "sid": 269,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the downtown area centered around this McDonald's,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 503.18,
      "to": 505.07,
      "sid": 270,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Pioneer Square is not as bustling as it used to be.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 505.07,
      "to": 506.79,
      "sid": 271,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But this place is similar to Little Saigon",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 506.79,
      "to": 508.85,
      "sid": 272,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with many fixed shops on both sides of the road",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 508.85,
      "to": 510.59,
      "sid": 273,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the exterior walls are covered with graffiti and such",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 510.59,
      "to": 513.21,
      "sid": 274,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I guess it will take some time before merchants return",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 513.21,
      "to": 514.21,
      "sid": 275,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "However, overall",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 514.21,
      "to": 515.77,
      "sid": 276,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the appearance of downtown Seattle",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 515.77,
      "to": 517.809,
      "sid": 277,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "has improved a lot since my last visit",
